    "diligence-gaps": "<section class=\"block kb-panel\" id=\"diligence-gaps\"><h2 class=\"section-title\"><span class=\"section-num\">十</span>待确认问题 / 尽调缺口</h2><p class=\"section-sub\">OPEN QUESTIONS · 按优先级排序</p><details class=\"oq-group\" open><summary><span class=\"oq-title\">P1 · 必须确认 — 权利与商业化闭环</span><span class=\"oq-count\">1 项</span></summary><ol class=\"oq-list\"><li class=\"oq-item\"><span class=\"oq-num\">①</span>授权是否覆盖商业化分发？<span class=\"oq-action\"> —— 影响：阻塞商业化路径；责任方：法务；下一步：提供完整授权样本</span></li></ol></details><details class=\"oq-group\" open><summary><span class=\"oq-title\">P2 · 建议确认 — 经济模型</span><span class=\"oq-count\">1 项</span></summary><ol class=\"oq-list\"><li class=\"oq-item\"><span class=\"oq-num\">②</span>单位经济与 ROI 是否可验证？<span class=\"oq-action\"> —— 影响：影响回报测算可信度；责任方：投资团队；下一步：提供历史项目数据</span></li></ol></details></section>",
